    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 a magical lite dating sim</strong>\u00a0\u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari is a college-aged witch who returns home for the first time in years to help her dad's delivery service. While delivering packages, she meets some familiar faces from high school...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari's Magical Deliveries is an otome game following Mari as she delivers packages and reignites old flames.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 love interests to romance (2 male, 1 female)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >around an hour of playtime</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 full game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-3 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lots of side characters to meet</p></li></ul>",
